{"version":"context-relations-v1-canary","words":{"bounce":[{"id":"krdict:15220:1","headword":"뛰어오르다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"낮은 곳에서 위로 몸을 솟구쳐 오르다.","englishExpression":"jump up; bounce","englishDescription":"For one's body to jump high from a low place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15220&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:38649:1","headword":"까불거리다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"물체를 계속 위아래로 흔들리게 하다.","englishExpression":"joggle; bounce; shake up and down","englishDescription":"To make an object move up and down constantly.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38649&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:42139:1","headword":"까불대다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"물체를 계속 위아래로 흔들리게 하다.","englishExpression":"joggle; bounce; shake up and down","englishDescription":"To make an object move up and down constantly.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42139&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:601157:1","headword":"팔딱이다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"작고 탄력 있게 뛰다.","englishExpression":"bounce","englishDescription":"To jump briskly and elastically.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=601157&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:601157:2","headword":"팔딱이다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"화를 참지 못하고 팔팔 뛰다.","englishExpression":"bounce","englishDescription":"To jump briskly without being able to control one&apos;s anger.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=601157&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:601157:4","headword":"팔딱이다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"심장이나 맥이 작게 뛰다. 또는 그렇게 되게 하다.","englishExpression":"bounce","englishDescription":"To make one&apos;s heart or pulse beat slo