ace twisted or wrinkled.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72200&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:86994:5","headword":"헝클다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"자세나 표정 등을 흐트러뜨리다.","englishExpression":"distort; disarrange","englishDescription":"To lose one's composure in posture or facial expression.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86994&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:89201:2","headword":"흐트러뜨리다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"겉모습, 자세, 태도 등을 단정하지 않게 하다.","englishExpression":"make untidy; disarrange; distort","englishDescription":"To lose one's composure in posture or fail to straighten one's conduct, attitude, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89201&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:89816:6","headword":"틀다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"잘되어 가던 일을 어렵게 하거나 잘못되게 하다.","englishExpression":"twist; distort","englishDescription":"To cause something which has proceeded well to become difficult or go wrong.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89816&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"fiancee":[{"id":"krdict:14314:1","headword":"약혼녀","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"결혼을 하기로 약속한 여자.","englishExpression":"fiancee; bride-to-be","englishDescription":"A woman that one has promised to marry.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14314&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:14316:1","headword":"약혼자","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"결혼을 하기로 약속한 사람.","englishExpression":"fiance; fiancee; the engaged person","englishDescription":"A person who one has promised to marry.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14316&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"informal":[{"id":"krdict:600399:1","headword":"비격식적","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"격에 맞는 일정한 방식이 아닌 것.","englishExpression":"informal","englishDescription":"Something that is not in a way that suits the class.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=600399&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:600400:1","headword":"비격식적","partOfSpeech":"determiner","partOfSpeechKo":"관형사","definitionKo":"격에 맞는 일정한 방식이 아닌.","englishExpression":"informal","englishDescription":"Not in a way that suits the class.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=600400&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:601277:1","headword":"비격식체","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"한국어에서 대화를 나누는 상대에게 부드러운 느낌을 주는 상대 높임법 중 하나.","englishExpression":"informal","englishDescription":"One of the ways to address someone in Korean that gives a soft feeling to the person you are talking to.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=601277&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"leaf":[{"id":"krdict:38858:1","headword":"나뭇잎","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"나무의 줄기나 가지에 달린 잎.","englishExpression":"leaf","englishDescription":"A leaf sticking out from the trunk or branch of a tree.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38858&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:70793:1","headword":"잎","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"줄기 끝이나 둘레에 붙어 있으며 녹색의 납작한 모양을 한, 식물의 영양 기관.","englishExpression":"leaf","englishDescription":"A vegetative organ of a plant, which is green, flat, and attached to the point or sides of a stem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70793&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:70793:2","headword":"잎","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"나뭇잎, 풀잎, 꽃잎 등을 세는 단위.","englishExpression":"leaf; petal","englishDescription":"A unit for counting the number of leaves of a tree, grass leaves, petals, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70793&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:70793:3","headword":"잎","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"식물의 이름을 앞에 붙여 그 식물의 잎을 나타내는 말.","englishExpression":"leaf","englishDescription":"A word that is attached behind the name of a plant to indicate the leaf of the plant.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70793&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:72923:1","headword":"이파리","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"나무나 풀에 달린 하나하나의 잎.","englishExpression":"leaf; blade","englishDescription":"An every single leaf that grows on a tree or plant.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72923&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:73861:1","headword":"잎사귀","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"나무나 풀에 달린 하나하나의 잎.","englishExpression":"leaf","englishDescription":"A leaf growing from a tree or stem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73861&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"mechanic":[{"id":"krdict:64927:1","headword":"수리공","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"고장 난 것을 고치는 일을 하는 사람.","englishExpression":"repairman; mechanic","englishDescription":"A person whose job it is to fix broken things.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64927&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:75809:1","headword":"정비공","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"기계, 기구, 시설 등이 제대로 작동하도록 살피고 고치는 기술자.","englishExpression":"mechanic","englishDescription":"A technician who takes care of and repairs machines, devices and facilities so that they can operate properly.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75809&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:76405:1","headword":"정비사","pa